Arguments are to be separated by \n. Do not submit a main function in your delivery, we will be adding our
own main in the file task02/main.c before calling your Makefile .
Our main.c file is as follows:
# include <stdlib .h>
# include " phoenix .h"
int main (int ac , char ** av)
{
char * str = concat_parameters (ac , av);
show_string ( str);
free ( str);
return ( EXIT_SUCCESS );
}
