The purpose of this function is to count the number of times two strings match .
When there are two or more asterisks, several string combinations are possible. Your function must calculate
the total number of such combinations.
For instance, abcbd and *b*match two times: ( a,cbd) and ( abc,d)
abcand a**match three times: ( nothing ,bc) ; (b,c) and ( bc,nothing ).
